/*
  IR Sensor Object Counting System - live dashboard served by the board.
  Project by: Brindha Sri, Devadharshini, Dhanyasri
  Board: ESP32 or ESP8266 (WiFi). IR module OUT -> IR_PIN, VCC -> 3.3V, GND -> GND.
  LCD (I2C 0x27): SDA/SCL pins of your board.
  Most IR modules (e.g. FC-51) pull OUT LOW when an object blocks the beam.
  1) Set WIFI_SSID / WIFI_PASS   2) Upload   3) Open the IP shown in Serial Monitor (115200 baud).
*/
